#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hyperv/hyperv.rst:105
msgid "On the |morpheus| appliance the krb5-user package must be installed."
msgstr "Auf der |morpheus|-Appliance muss das Paket krb5-user installiert sein."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hyperv/hyperv.rst:107
msgid "For Ubuntu the command is as follows:"
